  "prefLabel": "Ins 2702.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2702.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to implement the requirements of the Mental Health Parity and Addiction Equity Act of 2008 (MHPAEA), as amended, for group health insurance coverage that is provided to employers.\n\nSource. #9809, eff 11-8-10; ss by #12685, eff 12-3-18",
